  "cutscenes": {
    "note": "groups of cuts, each played once at its moment: when = enter (before the chapter's fight), time (at `at` seconds of the fight) and boss (when the boss comes) — these two are kept but no longer played: nothing stops a fight once it has begun (a special boss gets WARNING! instead) — clear (after the chapter is first cleared: shown after its result, on the way out). The fight waits while a cutscene is on. A group counts as seen when it ends or is skipped; a reward never waits on it (it is given with the clear). reward: the region reward shown after the group (the clear of an episode's last chapter leads into the next region). banner: a system line shown across the top of that cut. {next}: the name of the region after the group's own (from regions), with its particle (로/으로). text: Mano's own line (one or two short sentences), shown under speaker's name (a cut's who, if it has one, names someone else). Only wide (16:9) pictures are played (asked for): the tall (2:3) cutscenes of the regions were taken out; the regions' rewards of chapters 25, 30 and 35 that came after them stay as groups with no cuts (just the reward). when = launch: played once as the game is first opened, before the lobby (intro: the first four cuts of 작은 숲, made wide by scripts/survivor-intro-assets.py). Every wide cut fills the PC screen with the words over its foot.",
